                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d12b7dcb-23cc-3a03-8c5f-4131a148f29a",
                                        "entry_id": "d716bcd5-791c-391c-9c29-ac79c6f78d18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being inconsistent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "996e1195-7f00-4ae4-a181-b6a2ffae22c7",
                                                "sense_id": "d12b7dcb-23cc-3a03-8c5f-4131a148f29a",
                                                "text": "It was a strange inconsistency, but never till then had I been so much struck with the worthless and frivolous life of society. Never till then did I feel the deep and eternal debt of gratitude that human nature owes to those who assert its higher influence; who feel their generous activity stirred by a thrice noble emulation; who appeal from the present to the future, and redeem their kind, by shewing of how much that is good and great ambition and genius are capable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a68072a-421d-3ef7-82c9-ae4bc51be8df",
                                        "entry_id": "d716bcd5-791c-391c-9c29-ac79c6f78d18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An incompatibility between two propositions that cannot both be true."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb4731a3-7f19-4b6f-ad22-ebf35decc2c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "fe82433a-4cfd-37cd-8a36-50ef40e3fdee",
                        "source_sense_id": "42158255-09fd-35cf-b200-9e4cb85cdac0",
                        "source_sense_description": "insbesondere in der Logik: das Inkonsistenzsein; Widersprüchlichkeit",
                        "target_lang_word": "inconsistance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inconsistance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a5d089c-f6a0-30cf-b566-fd535b4c41bb",
                                        "entry_id": "a3427015-608d-3e75-9c69-f8acbeb26801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Défaut de consistance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff8badcd-9801-4ac8-9554-30e314ed8742",
                                                "sense_id": "0a5d089c-f6a0-30cf-b566-fd535b4c41bb",
                                                "text": "L’inconsistance d’une crème."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc1078ef-cf35-4c3f-b874-7805c67ac47e",
                                                "sense_id": "0a5d089c-f6a0-30cf-b566-fd535b4c41bb",
                                                "text": "Elle était un peu grasse et pourtant elle ne donnait pas l’impression d’inconsistance. C’est ce qui surprenait le plus Loursat. Il y avait dans la lourdeur de Nicole, dans sa placidité, comme une force au repos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82a2a679-b1e3-3617-8b4c-f88efd537aa4",
                                        "entry_id": "a3427015-608d-3e75-9c69-f8acbeb26801",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manque de soin et d’ensemble dans la conduite et dans les discours."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fe77469-4aa8-49a2-8801-b418cf876188",
                                                "sense_id": "82a2a679-b1e3-3617-8b4c-f88efd537aa4",
                                                "text": "L’inconsistance du caractère."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95280f07-be0a-46c9-aba9-aba1203590cf",
                                                "sense_id": "82a2a679-b1e3-3617-8b4c-f88efd537aa4",
                                                "text": "L’inconsistance de son raisonnement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b4aa4ff-b89d-4386-a45d-ee7edaa22605",
                                                "sense_id": "82a2a679-b1e3-3617-8b4c-f88efd537aa4",
                                                "text": "Pourquoi serions-nous chagrinés par l’inconsistance éventuelle d’un énoncé comme « il existe un type d’infinité supérieur à l’énormité », étant donné que nous désirons parvenir au plus près du lieu absolu, lequel in-consiste ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
